uv.lock: Uv: uv run serve --port 20010 (entry acme:main)
[tool.uv], not packaged: Uv: uv run serve --port 20010 (entry acme:main)
    note: uv installs [project.scripts] only for packaged projects; add a [build-system] table or `tool.uv.package = true` so `serve` exists
[tool.uv] package = true: Uv: uv run serve --port 20010 (entry acme:main)
poetry.lock: Poetry: poetry run serve --port 20010 (entry acme.cli:serve)
uv and poetry: Uv: uv run serve --port 20010 (entry acme:main)
    note: both uv and poetry are configured (poetry.lock is present); using uv
neither: error: `<lane>/pyproject.toml` has no uv.lock, [tool.uv] table or poetry.lock, so devlanes cannot tell uv from poetry; run `uv lock` or `poetry lock` in its directory
